        tips: ["Each email piece you switch on counts toward your Communication pillar. The quiet-client tasks do not change your scores.", "A client goes quiet after 2 weeks with no bookings, payments, emails or notes. You get a task to reach out, and nothing is emailed on its own.", "Someone gets each email once, and the quarterly pulse once a quarter. Unsubscribed contacts are always skipped."],
        image: { src: "/academy/client-care.jpg", alt: "The Client Care page with a note about setting up email sending, a box explaining who counts as a client by the client or customer tag, and switches for the 30-day check-in, Quarterly pulse, Exit survey and Quiet clients", caption: "Everything is written and switched off until you turn it on. This is a sample account." },
