        text: "In chat, your assistant can create a form or a booking link, or change an existing one. It can also add a deal, look up payments and unpaid invoices, and prepare an invoice or an offer payment link. All of that waits behind Approve, and nothing is sent until you press it. Undo puts a form or booking link back as it was. For Client Care, your assistant can tell you which pieces are on and which clients have gone quiet, but it cannot switch them on or off.",
